docs
*.tar
*.tar.gz
.env
.env.*

# Hidden files and directories at the root (local notes, editor and CI
# config) and root-level markdown are not build inputs. The final image
# copies only /out/ekokod, so they would never ship — but they would still
# enter the build context and the build cache, which a --cache-to export or a
# remote daemon exposes.
.*
!.dockerignore
/*.md
coverage.out
